<p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #1f2937;">
  Hello {{name}},
</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; color: #374151; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;">
  You have been assigned as an interviewer for an active job vacancy.
</p>

<!-- Bulletproof Highlight Box -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; border-collapse: collapse;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 16px 20px; background-color: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #1f2937;">
      <strong style="color: #1f2937;">Job Vacancy:</strong> {{jobTitle}}
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #374151; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;">
  As part of the hiring team for this role, you will be notified when specific candidates are scheduled for interviews with you.
</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 32px 0; color: #374151; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;">
  If you have any questions or believe this assignment was made in error, please reach out to the HR department or contact us at
  <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">{{supportEmail}}</a>.
</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: #1f2937; font-weight: 600; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;">
  {{emailClosingNote}}
</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;">
  <strong style="color: #1f2937;">{{supportTeamName}}</strong><br>
  {{companyName}}
</p>